  <iati-identifier>GB-GOV-1-301457-411</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dealing with Conflict Legacy in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project works to foster a conducive environment, based on trust and recognition of conflict legacies, contributing to community resilience. At the outcome-level the project aims to build trust and foster social cohesion, through improved interactions between families of the missing persons and wider community. The outcome will be achieved by addressing the need for a strengthened ability of civil society to engage with a unified voice with policy makers, and strengthened community resilience which builds inclusive and constructive narratives of the past.</narrative>
  </description>
